---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ReturnButton from '../components/ReturnButton';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | hoGAMEGATA" 
  description="Privacy policy and data protection details for visitors of the hoGAMEGATA horror game database." 
  withSearch={false} 
  withLink={true}
>
  <!-- Content -->
  <main class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-8 my-8 sm:my-12 pb-24 font-sans">
    <div class="max-w-3xl w-full border border-white/20 bg-[#09090c] p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl shadow-2xl flex flex-col gap-8 relative">
      
      <!-- Top header with Title & Return Button -->
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <h1 class="font-sans font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Privacy Policy
          </h1>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-400 font-normal">
            Data Protection and Privacy Information
          </p>
        </div>
        <ReturnButton client:only="react" />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-sans font-normal">
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how <strong class="text-white">hoGAMEGATA</strong> ("we," "our," or "the service"), operated by <strong class="text-white">aurostron</strong>, handles information when you visit our website. We are committed to transparency and keep data collection strictly limited to what is necessary to operate the directory securely.
        </p>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect very little personal information:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-neutral-400">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Account Information:</strong> If you register an account or sign in, we collect your email address and authentication credentials. This information is used strictly to authenticate your sessions, save your favorites and ratings, and send essential security notices. We never sell your contact details or send unsolicited marketing emails.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Technical and Security Logs:</strong> When you browse the site, our edge network automatically records standard connection data, including your IP address, browser type, operating system, requested URL, and timestamp. We use these logs exclusively to monitor system health, block automated scrapers, enforce rate limits, and mitigate malicious traffic.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">2. Service Providers and Infrastructure</h2>
          <p>We work with trusted technical service providers to host and secure the website:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-neutral-400">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Cloudflare:</strong> Provides edge network hosting, DNS routing, DDoS protection, content caching, and proxy services for game screenshots and media assets.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Turso (libSQL):</strong> Hosts our relational database containing the horror game catalog, developer listings, and user preferences.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            These providers process technical data only as required to deliver their respective infrastructure services to us.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">3. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
          <p>
            We believe in an ad-free, tracker-free web experience:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-neutral-400">
            <li>We do not run third-party advertising trackers, social network tracking pixels, or commercial analytics scripts (such as Google Analytics or Meta Pixel).</li>
            <li>We use only essential cookies and browser local storage to keep your account signed in, remember your volume or theme preferences, and save active catalog filters during your session.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">4. Data Retention</h2>
          <p>
            We keep data only as long as practical:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-neutral-400">
            <li><strong class="text-white">Account Data:</strong> Stored for as long as your account is active. If you choose to delete your account or email us requesting deletion, we permanently remove your account records within 30 days.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Server Logs:</strong> Edge network request logs are automatically rotated and purged on short retention cycles (typically 30 to 90 days), after which they are deleted or permanently anonymized.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">5. Your Rights (GDPR, CCPA, and Global Standards)</h2>
          <p>
            Depending on your location, privacy regulations (including the EU GDPR and California CCPA/CPRA) grant you specific rights over your personal information. These include the right to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-neutral-400">
            <li>Request a copy of the personal data we store about you (generally limited to your registered email address and saved list items).</li>
            <li>Request corrections to any inaccurate information.</li>
            <li>Request the complete deletion of your account and related records.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            To exercise any of these rights, email us directly at <a href="mailto:hello@gamegata.xyz" class="text-white underline hover:text-neutral-300">hello@gamegata.xyz</a>. We process requests promptly and without charge.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">6. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            hoGAMEGATA is not aimed at children under 13 (or under 16 where required by local law). We do not knowingly collect personal information from minors. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please let us know so we can delete the account promptly.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this policy periodically to reflect changes in our tools or legal duties. When updates are published, we revise the effective date at the bottom of this page. We encourage you to check back whenever you visit.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-4 text-sm font-sans text-neutral-300">
          If you have questions about our privacy practices, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@gamegata.xyz" class="text-white underline hover:text-neutral-200">hello@gamegata.xyz</a>.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer inside card -->
      <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-6 font-sans text-xs text-neutral-500 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-2 w-full">
        <span>© 2026 hoGAMEGATA Project</span>
        <span>Effective Date: September 2026</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
